<!--
  One compact visual size per sortie tier. Logical gameplay radii remain in
  rvm_sorties_rework.ltx; map circles are intentionally symbolic UI markers.
  PAW-style bounded scaling keeps them smaller while zoomed out and slightly
  larger while zoomed in, without restoring the old scale_max=3 growth.
  There is no mini_map entry: RVM has no minimap and this mod must not add one.
-->
